usage: create_data.py [-h] [--root-path ROOT_PATH] [--version VERSION]
                      [--max-sweeps MAX_SWEEPS] [--with-plane]
                      [--out-dir OUT_DIR] [--extra-tag EXTRA_TAG]
                      [--workers WORKERS] [--only-gt-database]
                      kitti

Data converter arg parser

positional arguments:
  kitti                 name of the dataset

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root-path ROOT_PATH
                        specify the root path of dataset
  --version VERSION     specify the dataset version, no need for kitti
  --max-sweeps MAX_SWEEPS
                        specify sweeps of lidar per example
  --with-plane          Whether to use plane information for kitti.
  --out-dir OUT_DIR     name of info pkl
  --extra-tag EXTRA_TAG
  --workers WORKERS     number of threads to be used
  --only-gt-database    Whether to only generate ground truth database.
